ENESTECH Software
, a part of TECHIIA Holding, is a dedicated developer of
SENET
â€” SaaS platform for automation of esports venues, gaming lounges, and cybercafes.
SENET was created in Kyiv, to help a small chain of gaming cafes to operate dozens of gaming computers and to provide better customer experience for gamers. Now, ENESETCH Software is an international company with a global presence and users in over 60 countries.
ENESTECH engages a full in-house team for development, support, sales, and marketing of SENET. It's an international crew that speaks 7 languages and knows everything about computer games.
Our company cherishes its Ukrainian origin and does not sell SENET to gaming cafes in Russia and Belarus. We also take active part in volunteering and support the Ukrainian Army in its fighting against Russian invasion.
We are currently looking for a
Content Manager
to join our team. Together with the team, you will introduce the world to our product, tell about the latest news and updates, and also keep abreast of trends in the world of eSports.
If you are an energetic person who wants to get involved in interesting projects, then you will definitely like working with us.
Join ENESTECH to create an eSports revolution together and turn quiet internet cafes into modern cyber arenas.
Responsibilities:
Creation and implementation of a content calendar;
Writing various content in SENET Blog, including announcements of new product modules, news from eSports life and other materials;
Writing content for our website pages to ensure that our product information is complete and up-to-date;
Writing product update posts that provide clear information about new features and capabilities;
Writing content for the product's social networks;
Writing PR publications that contribute to attracting of the media;
Working with translators and designers to ensure that our content is translated into different languages and has high design quality.
Requirements:
Work experience in a product company from 1 year;
Previous work experience as a Content manager/copywriter;
Love to create content and write various materials;
Fluency in English and Ukrainian (almost 100% of materials in English);
Openness, result orientation and self-organization in work;
Hands-on experience with Ahrefs will be a plus.
We offer:
Adequate and horizontal corporate culture;
Freedom to make your own decisions and take your ideas into work;
Remote work;
Easy and complete onboarding from colleagues;
Insurance after the trial period;
Paid sick leave for 12 days and 18 days of vacation;
Corporate course of Spanish;
Flexible 8-hour workweek without overtime, Mon-Fri;
Also, we have an office in Kyiv, 10 min walk from Poznyaky metro station. Youâ€™ll enjoy snacks at the kitchen and will play PS5, football, and table tennis in the lounge.
ENESTECH is a company that tries to create warm atmosphere among the crew. Itâ€™s a tradition now, to get together in our lounge, arrange Mortal Kombat or table tennis tournaments, play table games, and watch movies. During these disturbing times, we keep in touch and meet online every day. We are always happy to hear news from our colleagues, share work stories, and applaud success of our army. We volunteer and help each other to the best of our abilities.
Hope youâ€™ll join our team! Weâ€™re waiting for you at ENESTECH!
